mail/dma: Add dma version 0.14

dma is a small Mail Transport Agent for local mail submission and
outbound delivery. It supports local delivery, SMTP authentication,
TLS and certificate verification, without listening for incoming SMTP
connections.

Packaged in wip; updated to 0.14 by Philip Dodd.

Packaging supports unprivileged staging, with privileged executable
permissions applied during installation. The spool directory permits
submission through the setgid dma executable.
